course: dictionary
lesson: 509
title: Assent: saying yes officially
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Assent means agreement, or permission, especially when it is official. You will often meet it in history, law and exam texts. Look at the words around it to work out its meaning.
explain: «Royal Assent is the King's agreement that turns a bill into a law.» A bill is a plan for a new law. The clues are bill and law, so assent must be the step that makes the plan official. Swap in the word agreement and check that it still makes sense.
explain: As a verb, assent means to agree to something. In a story, someone might show assent with a nod, which means they say yes without speaking. Read the words around the word, and if you are still unsure, check a dictionary.
fact: Assent means agreement or permission, especially official agreement.
fact: As a verb, «assent» means to agree to something.
fact: Royal Assent is the monarch's official approval that turns a bill into a law.
fact: A bill must pass both Houses of Parliament before it gets Royal Assent from the King.
fact: By custom the King always gives Royal Assent; no monarch has refused for over 300 years.
fact: A nod of assent means a nod that shows you agree.
exercise: Royal Assent turns what into a law? | A castle | A dog | *A bill | A nod
exercise: What does assent mean? | Argument | *Agreement or permission | Loud noise | Rest after hard work
exercise: Ellie says a nod of assent shows someone is cross. What does a nod of assent really show? | They are cross | They are lost | They are asleep | *They agree
test: The verb «assent» means what? | To hide from others | *To agree to something | To argue loudly | To fall asleep
test: Which one is an example of Royal Assent? | A shop opening late | A child saying sorry | *The King's official approval of a bill | A dog wagging its tail
exam: The text says «by custom the King always gives Royal Assent.» What does the phrase «by custom» suggest? | It happens only once a year | *It is the usual, expected way | It is a rare, secret event | It has been banned
